# Never in the image: secrets, private or Suva-derived data (volumes at runtime instead), caches, git.
.git
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
data
tmp
backups
.venv
**/__pycache__
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
~$*
# Not needed at runtime: documentation, experiments, the decks and reports (PDF), the UI sources until the
# UI is built in the image (docs/DEPLOY.md §6).
docs
experiments
*.pdf
